        "Content": "* Spacious three-bedroom, two-bathroom own-door duplex apartment\r\n* Extending to approx. 83 sq. m.\r\n* Built in 1990 by Tudor Homes\r\n* Southeast-facing terrace overlooking landscaped communal grounds\r\n* Newly repainted throughout\r\n* Excellent scope for modernisation and upgrading\r\n* Electric central heating\r\n* BER C1\r\n* Permit parking within the development\r\n* No current rent cap – attractive investment opportunity"
